<title>UK: ABB Unit sets $350 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>ABB Unit sets $350 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT FROM ASEA BROWN BOVERI LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    14.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1575  PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PRVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
